WEBVTT

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:19.010
Yusei!  Jack!

00:00:19.010 --> 00:00:21.270
Is it true that someone hurt Ushio?

00:00:21.270 --> 00:00:22.060
Yes.

00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:23.470
How is he?

00:00:23.470 --> 00:00:25.750
He's getting emergency treatment.

00:00:27.490 --> 00:00:28.670
Ushio!

00:00:28.670 --> 00:00:29.900
Move out of the way!

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:32.580
We're going into emergency surgery!

00:00:30.170 --> 00:00:32.580
Ushio, what happened?

00:00:34.070 --> 00:00:38.580
Yusei, don't use Synchros against Ghost.

00:00:38.580 --> 00:00:39.850
Synchro?

00:00:40.020 --> 00:00:46.700
When an effect destroys Wise Core, all 
monsters on my field are destroyed.

00:00:46.700 --> 00:00:51.330
Then from my deck or my hand, I can 
Special Summon Meklord Emperor Wisel...

00:00:51.460 --> 00:00:52.900
Wisel Top...

00:00:52.900 --> 00:00:54.600
Wisel Attack...

00:00:54.600 --> 00:00:56.580
Wisel Guard...

00:00:56.580 --> 00:00:59.000
...and Wisel Carrier!

00:00:59.750 --> 00:01:02.790
You summoned five monsters at once?

00:01:02.790 --> 00:01:04.980
It's too early to be surprised.

00:01:04.980 --> 00:01:08.550
I activate Meklord Emperor Wisel's effect!

00:01:34.630 --> 00:01:38.310
The show is about to start!

00:01:38.310 --> 00:01:41.410
What's this giant robot?

00:01:58.950 --> 00:02:04.090
Every time you're hurt, you can become kinder

00:02:04.450 --> 00:02:09.620
Stand up and you'll understand strength

00:02:09.960 --> 00:02:14.100
Don't look back and keep going

00:02:14.330 --> 00:02:19.930
Both the past and the future 
are connected to the present

00:02:20.100 --> 00:02:24.910
There's no need to fear

00:02:25.140 --> 00:02:32.580
I'll keep telling you that you're not alone

00:02:33.650 --> 00:02:38.590
The passionate emotions in your heart

00:02:39.320 --> 00:02:44.360
Streak to the infinite future

00:02:44.560 --> 00:02:49.760
Dreams surpass their limits

00:02:50.030 --> 00:02:57.870
And will lead you to a bright place

00:03:24.570 --> 00:03:30.010
Proof of Evolution  Synchro Monster

00:03:41.650 --> 00:03:42.870
Yusei!

00:03:48.230 --> 00:03:49.190
Aki?

00:03:49.190 --> 00:03:51.380
Aki, what are you doing here?

00:03:51.790 --> 00:03:53.840
The same reason as you.

00:03:54.240 --> 00:03:56.060
Aki, you too?

00:03:56.480 --> 00:04:00.520
This mark lets me know 
that Yusei is battling.

00:04:01.110 --> 00:04:06.060
No matter how far apart we are, 
this mark binds us together.

00:04:08.750 --> 00:04:12.700
But I have a bad feeling this time.

00:04:14.610 --> 00:04:15.880
Yusei…

00:04:21.820 --> 00:04:25.240
I've never seen a monster like that before!

00:04:25.590 --> 00:04:28.230
That's Ghost, the man who defeated Ushio!

00:04:39.050 --> 00:04:40.190
What?

00:04:40.540 --> 00:04:43.360
A monster made of five cards?

00:04:43.360 --> 00:04:44.680
Hey Jack!

00:04:44.680 --> 00:04:47.010
What is that monster?

00:04:47.010 --> 00:04:49.870
I don't know.  I've never 
seen that monster before.

00:04:50.460 --> 00:04:54.840
But we'll find out its power 
in his duel against Yusei!

00:04:55.270 --> 00:04:57.780
Don't let your guard down, Yusei!

00:05:01.720 --> 00:05:04.250
I set two cards and end my turn!

00:05:04.250 --> 00:05:05.950
It's my turn.

00:05:09.500 --> 00:05:11.810
Go, Meklord Emperor Wisel!

00:05:18.590 --> 00:05:20.850
I activate the trap Shock Reborn!

00:05:21.960 --> 00:05:25.470
Battle damage is halved!

00:05:38.900 --> 00:05:40.700
I felt an impact...

00:05:41.380 --> 00:05:44.000
Due to Shock Reborn's effect...

00:05:44.000 --> 00:05:46.400
I can Special Summon a monster from my graveyard

00:05:46.400 --> 00:05:49.290
whose attack points are equal or less than
 the damage that I took!

00:05:49.290 --> 00:05:52.100
Resurrect, Turbo Booster!

00:05:54.130 --> 00:05:57.230
I set one card and end my turn.

00:06:03.980 --> 00:06:05.320
My turn!

00:06:07.710 --> 00:06:11.550
Meklord Emperor Wisel has 2500 attack points.

00:06:11.720 --> 00:06:14.400
In order to overcome its attack points…

00:06:24.850 --> 00:06:27.760
I activate Speed Spell - Angel Baton!

00:06:28.030 --> 00:06:30.670
When I have 2 or more Speed Counters...

00:06:30.670 --> 00:06:35.280
I draw two cards from my deck and send 
one card in my hand to the graveyard!

00:06:35.860 --> 00:06:40.780
Next, I summon this monster!  
Appear, Debris Dragon!

00:06:43.310 --> 00:06:46.310
When Debris Dragon is succesfully summoned,

00:06:46.310 --> 00:06:50.290
I can Special Summon a monster in my graveyard
 with 500 or fewer attack points!

00:06:50.290 --> 00:06:53.320
Resurrect, Gauntlet Warrior!

00:06:56.010 --> 00:07:03.260
Level 4 Debris Dragon tunes Level 3 Gauntlet 
Warrior and Level 1 Turbo Booster!

00:07:06.800 --> 00:07:10.090
The wishes come together 
to form a new shining star!

00:07:10.090 --> 00:07:11.790
Become the path that lights the way!

00:07:12.590 --> 00:07:13.810
Synchro Summon!

00:07:14.480 --> 00:07:17.210
Soar, Stardust Dragon!

00:07:18.620 --> 00:07:22.650
All right!  Their monsters now have 
the same amount of attack points!

00:07:24.320 --> 00:07:27.340
I activate the trap Meteor Wave!

00:07:28.530 --> 00:07:33.600
A Synchro Monster gains 300 
attack points during this turn!

00:07:34.880 --> 00:07:37.740
Stardust Dragon now has higher attack points!

00:07:37.740 --> 00:07:39.970
Go, Stardust Dragon!

00:07:39.970 --> 00:07:42.130
Shooting Sonic!

00:07:43.740 --> 00:07:46.070
I activate Wisel Guard's effect!

00:07:46.070 --> 00:07:50.280
Wisel Guard changes your 
attack target to this card!

00:07:50.280 --> 00:07:51.250
What?

00:07:57.150 --> 00:07:59.750
Due to Meteor Wave's effect,

00:07:59.750 --> 00:08:04.050
if my stronger monster attacks your 
weaker defense position monster,

00:08:04.050 --> 00:08:07.250
you take the point difference as damage!

00:08:10.250 --> 00:08:13.070
He lost a lot of life points!

00:08:13.840 --> 00:08:18.440
Even though they combined into one monster, 
they didn't combine into one card.

00:08:18.440 --> 00:08:21.800
That's why I could only 
destroy its right arm.

00:08:22.530 --> 00:08:25.250
I set one card and end my turn.

00:08:30.400 --> 00:08:33.810
I see.  I knew he was special.

00:08:33.810 --> 00:08:36.550
He's Yusei Fudo, the man who defeated Godwin.

00:08:36.550 --> 00:08:39.380
What a fun opponent.

00:08:41.220 --> 00:08:47.160
Yusei Fudo, I'll show you 
something interesting.

00:08:47.710 --> 00:08:49.300
My turn!

00:08:51.200 --> 00:08:54.270
I summon Wisel Guard 3!

00:09:06.590 --> 00:09:10.360
That monster is unbelievable!  
It combined with another arm!

00:09:10.360 --> 00:09:11.930
It's a combination monster.

00:09:11.930 --> 00:09:16.230
Even if it loses parts, it 
can power up with new parts!

00:09:17.730 --> 00:09:18.950
What?

00:09:20.980 --> 00:09:23.070
It's no use, Yusei Fudo.

00:09:23.070 --> 00:09:25.800
Meklord Emperor Wisel is immortal.

00:09:26.010 --> 00:09:31.000
I see.  Even if I destroy one 
part, it'll keep resurrecting.

00:09:31.000 --> 00:09:34.050
The five cards compensate for each other!

00:09:34.600 --> 00:09:36.990
This is worse than I imagined!

00:09:38.380 --> 00:09:41.510
You finally realized the 
terror of my Meklord Emperor.

00:09:41.510 --> 00:09:43.940
But the real horror is only starting!

00:09:43.940 --> 00:09:48.720
If you have so much power, why 
do you keep targeting D-Wheelers?

00:09:48.720 --> 00:09:53.000
D-Wheelers?  I'm not going after D-Wheelers.

00:09:53.000 --> 00:09:56.970
I'm just eliminating unnecessary 
things in the world.

00:09:56.970 --> 00:09:58.730
Unnecessary things?

00:09:58.730 --> 00:10:02.450
That's right.  Useless things 
called Synchro Monsters!

00:10:02.450 --> 00:10:06.080
Synchro Monsters are proof of 
humanity's newest evolution!

00:10:06.280 --> 00:10:08.830
We don't need things like that in this world!

00:10:08.830 --> 00:10:13.160
Taste the power of a Synchro killer, Yusei!

00:10:13.330 --> 00:10:14.890
Synchro killer?

00:10:14.890 --> 00:10:18.900
Meklord Emperor Wisel's effect activates!

00:10:25.780 --> 00:10:27.540
Stardust Dragon?

00:10:30.510 --> 00:10:36.740
Once a turn, Wisel can absorb a 
Synchro Monster on your field!

00:10:36.740 --> 00:10:37.440
What?

00:10:44.440 --> 00:10:46.940
No way!  Stardust Dragon...

00:10:46.940 --> 00:10:48.290
...was captured!

00:10:48.660 --> 00:10:50.290
Stardust Dragon…

00:10:52.000 --> 00:10:56.470
Yusei, don't use Synchros against Ghost.

00:10:57.510 --> 00:11:00.440
This is what Ushio was talking about.

00:11:00.840 --> 00:11:04.140
It's a robot that captures Synchro Monsters!

00:11:04.140 --> 00:11:11.530
Wisel gains attack points equal to the 
attack points of the Synchro Monster it equips.

00:11:11.860 --> 00:11:14.850
Stardust Dragon has 2500 attack points.

00:11:14.850 --> 00:11:19.740
Therefore, Wisel gains 2500 attack points!

00:11:20.510 --> 00:11:23.260
It absorbed Stardust's attack points!

00:11:23.260 --> 00:11:24.960
5000 attack points!

00:11:25.930 --> 00:11:28.070
Go, Meklord Emperor Wisel!

00:11:28.070 --> 00:11:30.600
Attack Yusei Fudo directly!

00:11:31.370 --> 00:11:36.210
Yusei Fudo, your own monster's 
power will defeat you!

00:11:38.380 --> 00:11:41.610
This is bad, Yusei!  You'll 
lose if you take this attack!

00:12:08.640 --> 00:12:13.110
Yusei Fudo, Meklord Emperor's 
single strike will destroy you!

00:12:17.780 --> 00:12:20.420
I activate the trap Scrap-Iron Scarecrow!

00:12:20.980 --> 00:12:26.250
When your monster attacks, 
this card negates that attack.

00:12:26.250 --> 00:12:28.830
After it activates, it can be set again!

00:12:34.760 --> 00:12:36.470
You're stubborn.

00:12:36.470 --> 00:12:40.070
I set two cards and end my turn.

00:12:41.340 --> 00:12:42.460
My turn!

00:12:44.230 --> 00:12:47.200
I summon Bicular in defense position!

00:12:48.800 --> 00:12:52.020
I set one card and end my turn!

00:12:54.180 --> 00:12:56.020
You can't do anything.

00:12:57.230 --> 00:13:00.000
There's nothing in my hand 
that can turn the tables.

00:13:00.470 --> 00:13:02.390
I just have to survive for now!

00:13:02.390 --> 00:13:04.160
My turn!

00:13:06.140 --> 00:13:09.230
I activate the trap Wise A3!

00:13:09.230 --> 00:13:13.080
By sending Wisel Attack on
 my field to the graveyard,

00:13:13.080 --> 00:13:16.760
I can Special Summon Wisel Attack 3 from my hand!

00:13:30.150 --> 00:13:36.090
Wisel Attack 3 increases Meklord 
Emperor Wisel's attack points!

00:13:36.660 --> 00:13:39.130
Go, Meklord Emperor Wisel!

00:13:43.850 --> 00:13:46.600
I activate the trap Scrap-Iron Scarecrow!

00:13:57.950 --> 00:14:00.200
Yusei is managing to survive.

00:14:00.200 --> 00:14:01.930
But he can't let his guard down.

00:14:01.930 --> 00:14:04.540
If his opponent's attack slips through…

00:14:05.000 --> 00:14:07.220
Yusei will lose.

00:14:07.220 --> 00:14:11.230
Since he stole Yusei's ace card, 
there's no way Yusei can win!

00:14:17.370 --> 00:14:20.310
The same strategy won't 
work against me again.

00:14:20.540 --> 00:14:22.840
I activate the trap Battle Return!

00:14:23.500 --> 00:14:30.810
When a monster couldn't battle this turn, it 
can attack again by halving its attack points!

00:14:30.810 --> 00:14:31.780
What?

00:14:35.560 --> 00:14:37.710
Go, Meklord Emperor Wisel!

00:14:42.360 --> 00:14:46.020
Scrap-Iron Scarecrow can only 
be activated once a turn!

00:14:46.020 --> 00:14:46.960
Yusei!

00:14:56.740 --> 00:14:59.610
Wisel Attack 3's effect activates.

00:14:59.610 --> 00:15:02.570
If its attack points are greater than your 
monster's defense points,

00:15:02.570 --> 00:15:04.370
you take the difference as damage!

00:15:06.090 --> 00:15:08.940
But I activate Bicular's effect!

00:15:08.940 --> 00:15:15.740
When Bicular is destroyed in battle, I can 
Special Summon Unicycular from my deck or my hand!

00:15:16.720 --> 00:15:19.000
That weakling can't do anything!

00:15:19.000 --> 00:15:21.560
I activate the trap Trap Recycle!

00:15:21.560 --> 00:15:24.790
I discard one card from my 
hand to activate it this turn.

00:15:24.790 --> 00:15:27.700
A trap card in my graveyard 
returns to my hand.

00:15:28.210 --> 00:15:31.110
I bring back Battle Return!

00:15:32.840 --> 00:15:38.580
But if I use this effect, I can't set the 
card I brought back to my hand this turn.

00:15:39.510 --> 00:15:41.050
This is bad!

00:15:41.050 --> 00:15:44.390
If he sets that card, there's 
no way Yusei can stop it!

00:15:44.390 --> 00:15:46.290
What are you doing, Yusei?

00:15:46.290 --> 00:15:49.290
Hurry up and destroy that minor villain!

00:15:49.290 --> 00:15:52.360
How dare you duel so 
pathetically in front of me!

00:15:53.490 --> 00:15:54.760
My turn!

00:16:01.260 --> 00:16:05.020
It seems that's not the card you wanted.

00:16:05.020 --> 00:16:09.080
Since you've lost the ability to 
Synchro, you're facing destruction!

00:16:09.290 --> 00:16:13.180
I activate the Field Spell 
Speed World 2's effect!

00:16:13.660 --> 00:16:19.310
By removing 7 Speed Counters, 
I can draw a card from my deck!

00:16:22.460 --> 00:16:25.950
Everything depends on this draw!

00:16:30.380 --> 00:16:31.840
What?

00:16:31.840 --> 00:16:33.800
The mark of the Crimson Dragon?

00:16:35.600 --> 00:16:36.650
The mark…

00:16:36.650 --> 00:16:38.100
...is glowing!

00:16:38.400 --> 00:16:41.580
Yusei is asking for our strength!

00:16:46.710 --> 00:16:48.700
The mark of the Crimson Dragon.

00:16:48.820 --> 00:16:52.140
I see!  You're lending me your strength!

00:16:52.280 --> 00:16:57.330
Ghost, no matter what you try, 
you can't stop our evolution!

00:16:57.330 --> 00:16:59.170
This is proof!

00:17:01.300 --> 00:17:02.180
Draw!

00:17:02.870 --> 00:17:05.140
Appear, Majestic Dragon!

00:17:09.720 --> 00:17:12.350
I activate the trap Synchro Material!

00:17:12.350 --> 00:17:19.140
Synchro Material lets me use a monster 
on your field to Synchro Summon!

00:17:19.140 --> 00:17:19.950
What?

00:17:20.780 --> 00:17:23.550
Return, Stardust Dragon!

00:17:23.550 --> 00:17:26.320
What?  You're taking back Stardust Dragon?

00:17:36.880 --> 00:17:38.000
Stardust!

00:17:38.000 --> 00:17:39.500
You did it, Yusei!

00:17:41.000 --> 00:17:48.080
Level 1 Majestic Dragon tunes Level 8 
Stardust Dragon and Level 1 Unicycular!

00:17:53.250 --> 00:17:57.570
The shining stars come together 
to illuminate a new miracle!

00:17:57.570 --> 00:17:59.300
Become the path that lights the way!

00:17:59.690 --> 00:18:01.160
Synchro Summon!

00:18:01.160 --> 00:18:04.210
Arrive, Majestic Star Dragon!

00:18:09.200 --> 00:18:13.120
Since Meklord Emperor lost 
Stardust, it loses attack points!

00:18:15.840 --> 00:18:23.380
But due to Wisel Guard 3's effect, 
it will block your attack!

00:18:23.380 --> 00:18:28.350
Too bad, but Majestic Star Dragon 
negates your monster's effect!

00:18:28.540 --> 00:18:32.720
Even if you negate it, your 
attack can't defeat me!

00:18:33.640 --> 00:18:37.190
Meklord Emperor Wisel is a 
monster made of five cards.

00:18:37.690 --> 00:18:41.730
Now that your effect is negated, 
I can attack any of its parts!

00:18:42.220 --> 00:18:43.430
You knew that?

00:18:43.430 --> 00:18:46.960
I'm attacking Meklord Emperor's head!

00:18:48.070 --> 00:18:50.240
Go, Majestic Star Dragon!

00:18:50.240 --> 00:18:54.290
Attack Wisel Top!  Shooting Blaster Sonic!

00:19:11.360 --> 00:19:12.290
What?

00:19:17.000 --> 00:19:18.300
Oh no!

00:19:18.300 --> 00:19:19.660
We have to save him!

00:19:37.640 --> 00:19:40.390
Yusei Fudo.  Interesting.

00:19:40.730 --> 00:19:43.420
We'll settle this someday.

00:19:50.480 --> 00:19:51.840
Are you okay?

00:19:51.840 --> 00:19:54.400
We'll take you to the hospital right away!

00:19:58.130 --> 00:19:59.880
What's this?

00:19:59.880 --> 00:20:01.230
What is he?

00:20:05.780 --> 00:20:07.780
It's a robot!

00:20:08.110 --> 00:20:09.420
A robot?

00:20:09.420 --> 00:20:11.270
What's going on?

00:20:19.280 --> 00:20:23.000
It's a Ridingroid that Security 
is currently developing.

00:20:23.380 --> 00:20:24.620
Ridingroid?

00:20:25.000 --> 00:20:28.970
It's a robot that handles D-Wheel violations.

00:20:28.970 --> 00:20:32.270
The test machine was stolen 
about ten days ago.

00:20:32.270 --> 00:20:34.940
I'm surprised that it's Ghost.

00:20:35.180 --> 00:20:36.910
Who did this?

00:20:36.910 --> 00:20:38.150
I don't know.

00:20:38.150 --> 00:20:40.920
Real damage from dueling...

00:20:40.920 --> 00:20:43.280
A test robot stolen from Security...

00:20:43.280 --> 00:20:45.190
There are a lot of mysteries.

00:20:45.190 --> 00:20:47.820
If only it left behind a memory chip.

00:20:47.820 --> 00:20:52.000
There was no data on the Riding Duel chip.

00:20:52.000 --> 00:20:57.450
It's programmed to wipe all 
the data when it loses a duel.

00:20:58.030 --> 00:21:00.560
You're not allowed to steal the evidence!

00:21:00.560 --> 00:21:02.570
Don't be so uptight.

00:21:02.570 --> 00:21:06.450
Yusei's skills are better 
than Security's analysis.

00:21:06.450 --> 00:21:08.140
That's true, but…

00:21:09.110 --> 00:21:12.300
I wanted to see that robot.

00:21:12.300 --> 00:21:14.630
Lua!  People were hurt!

00:21:14.630 --> 00:21:15.950
Sorry.

00:21:16.380 --> 00:21:21.490
But who and why would anyone want a 
robot that captures Synchro Monsters?

00:21:21.490 --> 00:21:27.100
I don't know, but it's clear 
that there's a new enemy.

00:21:27.300 --> 00:21:32.670
Exactly.  And if he's going to threaten 
our city, we'll keep fighting!

00:21:36.390 --> 00:21:39.970
The damage during that duel was real.

00:21:40.520 --> 00:21:46.300
Though the Dark Signers are gone, 
is there a new threat approaching?

00:22:09.320 --> 00:22:14.030
The small cliff floats on the Milky Way

00:22:14.030 --> 00:22:19.030
The sights I see are different 
than what I imagined

00:22:19.300 --> 00:22:23.940
Were you able to move on from the past?

00:22:23.940 --> 00:22:28.950
The answer isn't no, but 
there's something missing

00:22:29.140 --> 00:22:33.810
The cruel god tests us

00:22:34.110 --> 00:22:40.750
Let's fill the emptiness 
and head to the next stage

00:22:40.750 --> 00:22:44.620
If you ask me "What's our relationship?"

00:22:44.620 --> 00:22:50.490
We're more than friends... 
but that's not quite right

00:22:50.660 --> 00:22:54.400
Bond is the proper word

00:22:54.400 --> 00:23:00.370
As we fight, we understand each other

00:23:00.370 --> 00:23:03.340
"Where are you right now?"  "On Earth"

00:23:03.340 --> 00:23:05.580
Because I'm not an astronaut

00:23:05.580 --> 00:23:10.250
I have no problems when 
I'm below the ozone layer

00:23:10.550 --> 00:23:13.120
"I know, I'm coming right away."

00:23:13.120 --> 00:23:16.590
You want to party until the morning

00:23:16.590 --> 00:23:19.820
At our special place
